{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dark. Silent. Waiting.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a text-based, turn-based strategy mini-game that runs entirely on the command line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes on the role of a hunter, exploring a mysterious cave and attempting to hunt down a terrifying man-eating creature known as the &quot;Gurg.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, understanding your surroundings through messages that appear after each action is the key to survival and victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cave:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave consists of several rooms, each assigned a unique number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the overall structure of the cave is fixed, the room numbers are randomly assigned in each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the &quot;Gurg,&quot; two &quot;giant bats&quot; lurk somewhere in the cave. Yes, two of them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hunter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with a bow and three arrows, the hunter bravely challenges the Gurg.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is achieved by striking the Gurg with an arrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if the hunter is eaten by the Gurg, falls into a pit, or runs out of arrows, the game is over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each play session takes approximately 1 to 10 minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The introductory game guide can be skipped. For details, please check the \u201coption\u201d menu in-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The application relies on the user's command line environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no audio output.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gurg hunted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740500/4876e5e43a6c7f970dfbd38c26a5f09cb55d2a37.jpg"},{"name":"Hunter hunted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740500/eb8048b4b6504fec2433cf6a6ca6c07abe83388b.jpg"},{"name":"Hunter suicide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740500/4f633fd26d5089758d12c22157e6abb4be694d36.jpg"},{"name":"Exhausted arrows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740500/4d86eb18ae732938139fd2f5a9bcdbc5a77c3ce3.jpg"},{"name":"Lair fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740500/4b358d841bfd7ed23e0cd45bc696175f6e509514.jpg"},{"name":"Draw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740500/f6e453159e587f53eae0f32c874d1f8d8be09844.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740500?t=1762720893","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740500/debb8f763dff2e88940e20fb9845c9ec2da08e0b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762720893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740500/ad541517e99c2ea6d9a0d76ad18425af4b1a30e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762720893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740500/ad541517e99c2ea6d9a0d76ad18425af4b1a30e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762720893","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dark. Silent. Waiting.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a text-based, turn-based strategy mini-game that runs entirely on the command line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes on the role of a hunter, exploring a mysterious cave and attempting to hunt down a terrifying man-eating creature known as the &quot;Gurg.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, understanding your surroundings through messages that appear after each action is the key to survival and victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cave:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave consists of several rooms, each assigned a unique number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the overall structure of the cave is fixed, the room numbers are randomly assigned in each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the &quot;Gurg,&quot; two &quot;giant bats&quot; lurk somewhere in the cave. Yes, two of them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hunter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with a bow and three arrows, the hunter bravely challenges the Gurg.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is achieved by striking the Gurg with an arrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if the hunter is eaten by the Gurg, falls into a pit, or runs out of arrows, the game is over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each play session takes approximately 1 to 10 minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The introductory game guide can be skipped. For details, please check the \u201coption\u201d menu in-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The application relies on the user's command line environment.</p></li><li><p clas